  "-748239823": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1512517644,
   "children": [
    1520633495,
    1615005314
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Why did you choose me for this?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1300054030": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1512517644,
   "children": [
    -1125703677,
    1061553751
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "What’s with all these spirits anyway?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-2080885715": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1512517644,
   "children": [
    -1445649678,
    -624436911,
    -1277339674
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "What happens if we fail?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1445649678": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -2080885715,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "No one will notice at first. But then… misfortune will curse the land. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1125703677": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1300054030,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "When the barrier between worlds is weak, spirits slip through like water through cracks. Some seek vengeance, others simply chaos. They’re not all evil, but corruption twists them. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1520633495": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -748239823,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "I didn’t choose you, fool. The spirits did. The prophecy spoke of one who would come—a lost soul to wield the blade of balance.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-638672870": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1512517644,
   "children": [
    -160188175,
    -1433439815,
    157915828
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Why can’t you just defeat them yourself?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-160188175": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -638672870,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "If I were still the warrior I once was, this wouldn’t even be a conversation. But I’m old. Slower than I should be. My power wanes.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1615005314": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -748239823,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Maybe you’re just a pawn… or maybe you’re something more. Either way, fate has a twisted sense of humor.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1061553751": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1300054030,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "It’s why I’m here—to keep them in check.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-624436911": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -2080885715,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "People will fall ill without reason, accidents will become more frequent, and from time to time… someone will simply vanish.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1277339674": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -2080885715,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "It’ll seem like bad luck, but make no mistake—it’s the spirits, feeding on this world’s suffering. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1433439815": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -638672870,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Back in my youth, I could cut down spirits like paper. I was stronger than you ever will be. But now… every fight takes its toll. Soon, I won’t even be able to hold a blade.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "157915828": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -638672870,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "That’s why you must do it. You are my weapon.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "878410364": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1861829109,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Hmph. Go, then. But remember, every moment you delay, the spirits grow bolder. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1346056562": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 2115077581,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Hmph. We could order artifacts from my homeland, but they do not come cheap.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
